[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6482.95, "timestamp": "01:48:02", "text": "等等。我看到了进度。哇"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6499.59, "timestamp": "01:48:19", "text": "进度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6504.31, "timestamp": "01:48:24", "text": "啊，这么多等级。不，每个等级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6508.149, "timestamp": "01:48:28", "text": "还有，这就像我得到的默认枪一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6515.75, "timestamp": "01:48:35", "text": "我是不是在不知情的情况下玩的时候就已经解锁了这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6522.149, "timestamp": "01:48:42", "text": "说，是不是我把它弄成这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6533.035, "timestamp": "01:48:53", "text": "我希望不是。[音乐] （"}]